  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan, transitive)",
  "gloss": "to chip in; to pool; to contribute jointly",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to chip in; to pool; to contribute jointly",
      "explanation": "For each person in a group to put in money, ideas, or effort toward a shared purpose."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31293_dashiau_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}う。",
      "english": "To chip in money.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31293_dashiau_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦みんな→みんな：02972_minna⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦アイデア→アイデア：10161_aidea⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}った。",
      "english": "Everyone pooled their ideas.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31293_dashiau_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{友達|ともだち}→友達：01478_tomodachi⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}って、⟦{先生|せんせい}→先生：00609_sensei⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{花束|はなたば}→花束：03135_hanataba⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{贈|おく}った→贈る：09862_okuru⟧。",
      "english": "My friends and I chipped in and gave our teacher a bouquet.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧ (put out) + 〜⟦{合|あ}う→合う：10466_au⟧ (together, each other).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}う: to chip in money\n- ⟦{意見|いけん}→意見：01303_iken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}う: to share opinions\n- ⟦アイデア→アイデア：10161_aidea⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}う: to pool ideas, to brainstorm\n- ⟦{知恵|ちえ}→知恵：03428_chie⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{出|だ}し{合|あ}う: to put heads together\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Transitive: the thing contributed takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧.",
